[Adblock Plus 2.0]
! Title: Work tools compatibility - built-in trial v1
! Assembled: 2026-09-24
! Independent allowlist: not derived from, or intersected with, any blocklist.
! Every rule permits the named domain and its subdomains.
! Intended application: Work profile only, with ordinary blocking enabled.
! Best-effort starter; vendor roots are deliberately broader than individual SDK endpoints.
! Documentation sources identify services/endpoints, not a guarantee of complete coverage.
! Customer-owned custom domains and self-hosted deployments are not enumerated.

